\":\"Excellent! My team of supervisors has been assembled. Now I'll issue comprehensive orders to each supervisor to develop their portions of the backend infrastructure plan.\\n\\n###order_auth_plan_001###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: ORDER\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"orderString\\\": \\\"Supervisor Tarkin, please develop a comprehensive authentication and identity management plan for the HOA website. Your plan should include: 1) AWS Cognito User Pool configuration with appropriate password policies and MFA options, 2) User groups design (e.g., 'residents', 'board-members', 'admins') with proper attribute mappings, 3) Identity Pool setup for temporary AWS credentials, 4) Integration strategy with the frontend (JWT tokens, refresh mechanisms), 5) User registration/invitation workflow, 6) Password reset and account recovery procedures, 7) Session management and security best practices. Include all specific Cognito configurations, IAM roles, and security policies needed. Identify any custom Lambda triggers required for the authentication flow.\\\",\\n  \\\"recipientAgentID\\\": \\\"7\\\",\\n  \\\"orderSequenceID\\\": \\\"auth_plan_001\\\"\\n}\\n###order_auth_plan_001###\\n\\n###order_data_plan_002###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: ORDER\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"orderString\\\": \\\"Supervisor Vanto, please architect the data storage and security layer for the HOA website. Your plan should cover: 1) S3 bucket structure for document storage (meeting minutes, financial reports, etc.) with proper naming conventions, 2) DynamoDB table design for document metadata, user profiles, and content management, 3) Encryption strategy (at-rest and in-transit) using KMS, 4) IAM policies for fine-grained access control based on user groups, 5) S3 lifecycle policies for document archival, 6) Backup and disaster recovery strategy, 7) Data access patterns and query optimization, 8) Compliance considerations for sensitive financial data. Provide specific table schemas, S3 bucket policies, and KMS key configurations.\\\",\\n  \